window.products.push({"id":349052,"name":"Solaron Silky Soft Checkered Mink Plush Korean Style Luxury Blanket 87\" x 94\" - By Solaron","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TeTJHHNoL._AC_SL1229_.jpg","description":"From the makers of solaron blankets we would like to present to you their new line of blankets, Vivalon! this is one of the softest, brightest, and plushest printed Blanket on the planet! these blankets are extra warm and have superior durability. They are easy to care for, and are machine washable and dryable. For those of you who know about solaron blankets you know what kind of Blanket they make, they're the king of Korean mink blankets. This is the top notch top quality Korean style mink Blanket. This Blanket is made of polyester, and is 87\"x94\" in size. Makes a great gift for that special someone in your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TeTJHHNoL._AC_SL1229_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOLARON","source_asin":"B01N4FMGYO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4FMGYO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4FMGYO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":349053,"name":"Kai KS7068 fixed blade,hunting knife,outdoor,camping, Paring-3.5 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sa7SdbbvL._AC_SL1141_.jpg","description":"Essential to any kitchen, a paring knife is the go-to knife for peeling, coring, and other detail work. The Kai Luna Paring Knife features a slightly wider blade than some paring knives, making it great for working on a cutting board. You’ll love how it minces garlic or small herbs quickly and easily. This little gem also makes garnishing is a breeze. The Kai Luna series is not only eye-catching, but offers exciting style and performance at a value price. But value pricing does not mean sub-par quality: Kai Luna is designed and hand-crafted to give you excellent cutting performance. The high-carbon stainless steel blade has been expertly hardened for exceptional edge retention, strength, and rigidity. Each blade features a mirror polish on the upper part and a graze finish on the lower part that is not only aesthetically pleasing, but enhances stain and corrosion resistance. The hand-sharpened edge features a razor-sharp 16° cutting edge each side. Make with high-quality steel, Luna is easily the equal of much higher-priced competitors. The line offers soft-grip overlays on the top and bottom of the handle provide a secure grip, yet offer lightweight maneuverability and reduced cutting fatigue. Each knife comes with a matching storage sheath for protecting your blades when not in use. Luna by Kai is the quality professional’s demand, at a price aspiring chefs can afford.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Sa7SdbbvL._AC_SL1141_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kai","source_asin":"B085H3JFN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085H3JFN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085H3JFN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
