window.products.push({"id":349066,"name":"Replacement Ninja Cups for Blender 24 oz Bullet Cups (2pack) with To-Go Lids fit Nutri Ninja BL480 BL481 BL482 BL642 BL682 NN102","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rv56SI8QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【POWERFUL FUNCTION】- Whether the blade is sharp and the juicer cup is sealed is very important for us to buy juicer cups and blades. The 24oz blender cup produced by Funmit is exactly what you want. We use stainless steel blades with a thickness of 2.4MM. The 7-fins base can provide more cutting power for the blade, which can easily shred fruits and even nuts. Both the blade and the mouth of the cup have a sealing ring, so you don't have to worry about the juice splashing out during use ✅【SHOPPING TIPS】- ⭐Please confrim whether your juicer has the installation position of 7 fins before use, and the diameter of the blade is 4 inches. If your juicer cup is not 4 inches in diameter and does not have 7 fin mounting slots, then our blender cups and blades are not suitable for your juicer! Or you can refer to the matching model diagrams provided by us ✅【PERFECT COMPATIBILITY】- blender replacement parts are compatible with: BL2012 / BL2013 / BL480 / BL480D / BL481 / BL482 / BL486CO / BL487 / BL487A / BL488W / BL490 / BL491 / BL492 / BL492W / BL640 / BL642 / BL642W / BL642Z / BL680A / BL682 / NN100A / NN101 / NN102 ✅【HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL】- blender parts are made of high-quality rubber, BPA-free High Impact Plastic and food-grade stainless steel that are factory-tested by the manufacturer. Safe & Non-toxic & Non-polluting. Replacement blades can provide your juicer with more stable, safer and faster chopping, grinding, blending functions ✅【SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE】- Funmit adhere to provide all customers with a simple, streamlined shopping experience of large appliance replacement parts, and prove that we have the highest quality parts and service out there. We stand by our products, and our customers are our focus as a business. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact Funmit customer service team in time, and we will try our best to solve your problems","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rv56SI8QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funmit","source_asin":"B09XMDBJPC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XMDBJPC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XMDBJPC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":349067,"name":"Forest Decor Wood Soap Dishes, Set of 2, Rustic Bathroom Decor, Handcrafted Bar Soap Holder with Drain, Wooden Soap Dish, 100% Natural, Eco-Friendly (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H8sO2Yh0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURAL HAND WOODEN SOAP DISH – Beautiful and rustic, this wood soap dish holder is crafted with genuine olive wood and carved by hand to create a decorative and functional accessory that can be used in the kitchen or bathroom. KITCHEN TO BATHROOM AND BEYOND – Every order comes with two versatile wooden soap holders, which means you can keep one by the sink in the kitchen and one in the bathroom. Great for adding rustic, farmhouse charm to any space. THICK, DURABLE WOOD DESIGNS – We make each of these wood bar soap holders with high-quality olive wood that’s naturally water-resistant and well-suited for humid rooms, so you don’t have to worry about rot, moisture, or moldy residue. CONVENIENT, BUILT-IN DRAINAGE – Be it our bowl style soap dish holders with drain holes on the bottom or our flat grooved soap holders that let water drain out both sides our dishes help shed water to prevent pooling and damage. PREMIUM HANDMADE CRAFTSMANSHIP – As a family-owned and operated business, we focus on premier handmade craftsmanship which is why each piece is beautifully unique in terms of color, pattern, texture, and even size for true exclusivity. Explore the rest of our rustic home decor collection, including wood bathroom and kitchen accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H8sO2Yh0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Forest Decor","source_asin":"B0BH4M4N79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH4M4N79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH4M4N79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
