window.products.push({"id":349075,"name":"Nemesis Now B4725P9 Edgar's Raven Goblet 18cm, Resin w. Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81luJMGc5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"And the raven quote, nevermore. The cup is covered in intricate baroque patterns, twisting in alternate directions, framing a quartet of fleshless Raven Skulls. Each cranium curves around the cup of the goblet and sits on a royal purple base. Engraved on each are the words Quoth the Raven Nevermore, referencing the works of Gothic genius, Edgar Allen Poe. The long stem is formed from a large ornate silver key, accented with a small skull. The skull is mirrored on the base which features a Deaths Head Moth raised from similar baroque designs that can be seen on the cup. Cast in the finest resin before being expertly hand-painted, this Gothic Goblet has a removable stainless steel insert for ease of cleaning. Celebrate Poes twisted mind today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81luJMGc5fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nemesis Now","source_asin":"B07WRDP86W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349075","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WRDP86W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WRDP86W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
