window.products.push({"id":349126,"name":"Cuisinart Digital TOA-65 AirFryer Toaster Oven (Silver) with Hoffritz Commercial Knives and Fried Cuisine Cookbook Bundle (4 Items)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XXTABCBAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cuisinart Digital TOA-65 AirFryer Toaster Oven (Silver) Cuisinart makes AirFrying easier than ever, with presets to perfectly fry favorites like wings, fries, chicken nuggets, snacks, and veggies. Frying with air instead of oil is delicious and guilt-free, and this large capacity oven fries up to 3 pounds at once. It also offers all the great features of a full-size toaster oven. And that’s not all! Unique to the Cuisinart Digital AirFryer Toaster Oven is a range of low temperatures that lets you proof dough, dehydrate food, and more, taking multi-functionality to a whole new level. With the large digital display and intuitive programming options, selecting presets, temperature, time, and function have never been easier. Designed for Perfect Results Specially engineered 1800W motor, fan, and heater deliver high-velocity, high-heat airflow for perfectly fried results with minimal noise. The Digital AirFryer Toaster Oven offers a wide temperature range from 80 to 450 degrees F. It also offers low temperature settings to slow cook, braise and more. Plus, dedicated functions for Dehydrating and Proofing. Versatile Applications Cuisinart Digital AirFryer comes with a wide range of toaster oven functions like baking, broiling, roasting, toasting, reheating, and dual cooking. With a 0.6 cubic feet capacity, you can airfry up to 3 pounds at once, toast six bagel halves, roast a 4-pound chicken, or bake a 12\" pizza. It features adjustable preset time ranges for each function. Defrost and high/low convection fan speed options are also available. Bundle Includes: Cuisinart Digital TOA-65 AirFryer Toaster Oven (Silver) Cuisinart Digital TOA-65 AirFryer Toaster Oven (Silver) Hoffritz Commercial 7-Inch Santoku Knife (Navy Blue) Hoffritz Commercial 7-Inch Santoku Knife (Navy Blue) Hoffritz Commercial 5.5-Inch Serr Utility Knife (Navy Blue) Hoffritz Commercial 5.5-Inch Serr Utility Knife (Navy Blue) Fried and True: Crispy and Delicious Dishes from Appetizers to Desserts Fried and True: Crispy and Delicious Dishes from Appetizers to Desserts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XXTABCBAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B08J8FQL63","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J8FQL63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J8FQL63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
