window.products.push({"id":349144,"name":"GelPro Antifatigue Kitchen Mat, Wicker: Saddle 20 X 48","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AUf-jVndL._AC_.jpg","description":"Professionally engineered with the resilient, shock-absorbing 100% gel core, this GelPro wicker mat bounces back to provide continuous support and therapeutic pain relief. This kitchen mat features a thick gel core that provides anti-fatigue relief for your feet, legs and back. The GelPro patented, shock-absorbing gel core noticeably reduces the strain while standing for long periods of time. When doing prep work or cooking over a stove top, this mat provides extra support and cushioning for your feet.The smooth lush feel of tightly-woven, tropical reed-like fibers under your feet in five designer colors: auburn lends the distinctive earthy colors of redwood to kitchen, bath or entranceway. Cork evokes the warmth of a sandy grassland just before the tide. Oakwood, like the color of mink, is a soothing room-enriching color. Oyster grey is a light warm grey interwoven with dark grey overtones. Saddle blends dark brown with golden highlights to complement light or dark cabinetry. The GelPro wicker mat features nonslip surface and beveled edge to easily roll serving carts. Antimicrobial bottom surface resists mold, mildew and prevents mat from sliding. Wipe clean with a damp cloth. National Floor Safety Institute (NFSI) certified. Designed and assembled in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AUf-jVndL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GelPro","source_asin":"B0058VCPZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0058VCPZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0058VCPZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":349145,"name":"PackIt Freezable Classic Lunch Box, Charcoal Camo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LXZs7YrQL._AC_SL1178_.jpg","description":"The old-school lunchbox is getting PackIt's cool twist! PackIt's Fully Freezable Lunch Box is the only lunchbox with built-in cooling that chills food and drinks for hours. The secret is PackIt's groundbreaking technology: a freezable non-toxic gel liner is integrated into the walls of the lunch box. The design totally eliminates the need for separate ice packs or gel packs! To use, simply flatten the lunch box and place it in the freezer overnight (12 hours for optimal results). In the morning, the walls of the lunch box will be completely frozen and ready to chill. With fully frozen walls, this lunchbox keeps food cooler longer, which means you can pack healthier foods that would spoil in other lunch boxes such as: dairy, deli meats, salads, fruits and veggies. The Classic Freezable Lunch Box by PackIt easily fits an entire meal and a 12 ounce (340ml) drink. A top-load design makes this lunch box simple to pack, and its kid-friendly zipper closure locks in cold, dry air. A slim exterior zip pocket is perfect for lunchbox notes, ID cards, napkins or wipes. A buckle handle lets you clip the lunchbox onto totes, backpacks or sports bags. PackIt's Classic Lunchbox is made with nontoxic gel and gel liner. Like all PackIt products, the Classic Lunchbox is made from PVC free, BPA free, phthalate, and lead free (UL #B80321985, 12/5/2019) materials. Care: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe. PackIt's Classic Freezable Lunch Box measures 8.25 inches tall standing upright, 10 inches wide from side to side and 4.25 inches front to back/deep. When collapsed for freezing, it measures a slim 8.5 by 10 by 2.25 inches for easy storage in the freezer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LXZs7YrQL._AC_SL1178_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B0BLJ1V2J4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLJ1V2J4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLJ1V2J4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
