window.products.push({"id":349212,"name":"12oz/16oz Aluminum Can Crusher, Heavy Duty Pneumatic Can Compactor, Automatic Discharge after Crushed Soda Beer Cans, Safe and Efficient Recycling Too","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k57lcFWZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why recycling cans is important There’s a good reason why so much emphasis is put onto the recycling of aluminum cans — namely, the lifespan of recycled aluminum is essentially “endless”. In other words, there is no limit to the number of times an aluminum can is able to be recycled, and the energy and capital equipment required to recycle is significantly lower than it is for the production of new aluminum. If you have a lot of cans to crush, the process is likely to be rather time consuming. Trying to crush the cans one by one is likely to become rather boring very quickly. Fortunately, The Aluminum Can Crusher Crush has been designed to make this issue a thing of the past. Going the Distance Last but not least, pay close attention to how durable the can crusher is likely to be. This is an especially important consideration if your new model is likely to get a lot of use. Generally speaking, models that feature a steel body tend to be more durable than plastic models.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k57lcFWZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TELERABBIT","source_asin":"B09186BPBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09186BPBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09186BPBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
