window.products.push({"id":349262,"name":"25Pcs Dried Preserved Eucalyptus Stems for Shower, 17\" Real Fresh Eucalyptu Branches Plant Bundle Leaves Decor, 100% Natural Dried Flowers Bulk, Vase ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rlN3c5rrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【🌿100% Natural Eucalyptus Branches for Shower🌿】- The package includes 25 stems, comes with a free 3.3ft hemp rope. The eucalyptus stems are about 16''-17'' length. Our eucalyptus shower bundle are 100% from nature, non-toxic, healthy and environmental-friendly. 【🌿Pure and Natural Eucalyptus Flavor🌿】- The unique fragrance makes eucalyptus perfect plant for shower. When you hang eucalyptus in the shower, the steam will promote the release of the essential oils of eucalyptus. The smell will help with decongestion, rough skin, headaches, inflammation, stress, and muscle tightness. 【🛁Enjoy your Eucalyptus SPA🛁】- Hemp rope are included in the package, you can hang the eucalyptus bundle in the shower easily and enjoy your eucalyptus home SPA at any time. Except eucalyptus shower bundle, you can match with something like rose, lavender, rosemary or aromatherapy oil to make your exclusive shower bundle. Usually, the flavor of natural eucalyptus leaves will lighter over time. For the best results, we recommend replace the shower eucalyptus bundle at least once a month. 【🌿 Ideal Eucalyptus Decor and Gift Choice🌿】These dried eucalyptus plants stalks showing off a charm and style, add an effortless touch of texture and decor to your space, great for home or venue decoration like Boho weddings bouquets, add oomph to your tables, gardens, cafes, restaurant, office and DIY a Christmas and door wreath etc. 【🌿A Friendly Reminder🌿】- Our preserved eucalyptus bundles do not wilt or crumble and maintain soft leaves. If you notice that some leaves are slightly curled, don't worry, they can be restored to their fluffy state. While we strive to select the best eucalyptus for our customers, please understand that there may be slight variations in the fullness and length of the stems due to their natural origin. 【🌿Excellent After-sales Service🌿】 - To better serve our customers, we have formed professional after-sales service team. If you have any problems when using the eucalyptus for shower or decor, or just have advice for our product and service, please just feel free to contact us at any time. We'll provide you with a satisfactory solution within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rlN3c5rrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUKUOKA","source_asin":"B0C5R7RWLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5R7RWLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5R7RWLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
