window.products.push({"id":349325,"name":"Swift Home Luxurious Extra Warm, Fluffy Ultra-Plush Reversible Faux Fur and Sherpa 3-Piece Down Alternative Comforter & Sham Set – Navy, King/Cal King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91q9pSSPL-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SWIFT HOME DIFFERENCE: Indulge in sumptuous comfort during the winter months with our Reversible Faux Fur and Sherpa Comforter. Fully reversible, the lush long pile faux fur is soft and fluffy while the plush sherpa, a synthetic pile fabric that resembles wool, provides extra comfort and warmth. The classic box stitching is not only decorative, but also keeps the down-alternative filling from shifting during use and wash. Make this comforter an essential for keeping out the cold. PRODUCT CONTENT: 100% faux fur and sherpa polyester shell – The faux fur provides a fluffy cloudlike texture on one side while the sherpa gives a warm, plush reverse. It is filled with down-alternative polyester fibers that will not trigger sensitivities. WHAT’S INCLUDED:King/California King Set –One comforter 104”x 90” and two king pillow shams 20”x 36” EASY CARE: Machine wash separately on gentle cycle with cold water and like colors. Tumble dry on low and remove promptly or air dry. Do not use bleach. Lightly fluff after it is dry to reshape if needed. We recommend using a large capacity washer and dryer to avoid any damage to the comforter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91q9pSSPL-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swift Home","source_asin":"B07YN63HXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YN63HXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YN63HXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
