window.products.push({"id":349395,"name":"Idealiy Happy Easter Eggs Shower Curtain Hooks Rings Set of 12 Resin Shower Hooks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rqJMOeqpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Material: Our shower hooks are made of stainless steel and crystal glass. It’s durable. Size: Hook diameter of this shower hooks chrome is about 1.1\", decorative crystal glass diameter is about 1.45\". Available for 0.3\"-1.1\" (8-28mm) diameter rod. Easy to install: simply thread through existing holes and hang over shower rod. Vibrant print on one side which adds style to your shower rod. Package Included: 12 x Shower Curtain Hooks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rqJMOeqpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Idealiy","source_asin":"B07VFTH3H9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VFTH3H9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VFTH3H9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":349396,"name":"Rumble Jar - Next-Gen Cold Brew Coffee Maker for Mason Jars - 200 Micron Filter Is Ideal for Coarse Grounds & Stronger Coffee - Standalone Filter (no ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W3mE3BhVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A BETTER FILTER THAT MAKES STRONGER COLD BREW COFFEE: Cold brew experts designed this filter to make professional-quality cold brew in a Mason jar. Our 18/8 stainless steel filter features 200 micron holes, the ideal size for allowing water to circulate and optimal extraction to occur with coarse-ground coffee. It’s a radical improvement to those first-generation brewers with fine mesh screen filters, which are more suited to brewing hot coffee with finer grounds. You’ll taste the difference. KEEPS COFFEE FRESHER THAN THE COMPETITION: Oxidation is the enemy of fresh coffee, so the key is to keep air out. Unlike traditional sit-on-top mesh filters, our next-generation filter rests fully inside the Mason jar, allowing the Mason jar’s lid to maintain its famous airtight seal. This keeps your cold brew fresher. The intact seal also means the jar stays leakproof, so it's truly portable and means an end to coffee leaking coffee all over your hands, kitchen and clothes. NOVEL DESIGN BELOVED BY ITS KICKSTARTER BACKERS: The patent-pending capped-filter design features an ultra-sturdy, dent-resistant 18/8 stainless steel filter, with your choice of color for the food-grade silicone cap. The cap keeps grounds sealed inside the filter, while also working as a shock absorber that prevents rattling and protects the filter. Now you can say goodbye to those flimsy mesh filters that can produce weaker cold brew and easily fray, rip and get clogged up. BREWING PROCESS IS SIMPLER THAN EVER: Professional-quality cold brew takes less than a minute to prepare at home. After adding coffee grounds and water, just tighten the lid and rotate the jar horizontally/sideways 2 or 3 times. This \"rumble\" step activates the brewing process. Then let it sit overnight and your cold brew will be ready in the morning, tasting like a barista made it. Cleanup is even faster than the prep. COMPATIBLE WITH WIDE-MOUTH 32OZ MASON JARS (NOT INCLUDED): Product includes a stainless steel filter with food-grade silicone cap and a 100% cotton filter-bag that can be used as an optional second stage of filtration if you brew with fine grounds (remember: coarse grounds are best for cold brew). Compatible with wide-mouth Mason jars only (i.e. not regular mouth jars). The stated 1-quart capacity represents the volume of the Mason jar, not the volume of the filter. BPA free. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W3mE3BhVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rumble Jar","source_asin":"B09XPT993C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XPT993C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XPT993C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":349397,"name":"Tupperware One Touch Reminder Canisters, Set of 4, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315GCB77WJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Newly designed seal for easier use. Amazon.com Ideal for storing staples on the countertop, the four canisters in this set have clear windows near their bottoms that serve as reminders when the canisters' contents run low. Otherwise, the canisters are opaque to protect food from direct light. Tupperware's legendary seals--virtually airtight and moisture-proof--ensure food remains fresh and flavorful. The seals open and close with one hand and one touch: pressing the center with fingers or thumb is all it takes to snap them tight. Made of rigid, rugged, glossy plastic, the canisters graduate in size, from 5 cups (5-1/8-inch diameter, 6 inches high), to 8 cups (6-inch diameter, 6-7/8 inches high), to 12 cups (6-3/4-inch diameter, 7-1/4 inches high), to 17 cups (7-1/2-inch diameter, 8-3/8 inches high). They stack for compact storage and nest when empty. Virtually unbreakable and dishwasher-safe, Tupperware carries a lifetime warranty against chipping, cracking, breaking, and peeling. This set's seals are Black. Others have Bold 'N Blue or Hunter Green seals, offering color-coordination choices for a kitchen and a color-coding system for storage and complementing Tupperware's Modular Mates and Cereal Storer seals. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315GCB77WJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tupperware","source_asin":"B00005U19L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005U19L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005U19L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
