window.products.push({"id":349519,"name":"GOODESERVE Glass Pitcher - 51 OZ Water Fridge with Lid Ice Tea Maker 18/8 Stainless Steel Easy Clean Heat Resistant Borosilicate Jug for Juice, Milk, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r8GXJfUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GOODESERVE is a glass manufacturer that combines design and production. We equip professional design team and processing plant and provides better products.We keep innovation and hard work to improve. Want to drink homemade drinks at the will？Using our aesthetical and elegant glass pitcher. 10 reason why chose ours. 1.Made from borosilicate glass - hand blown,heat-resistant and 100% lead-free. 2.The lid seal when pour - The lid keep tight on outlet in case drip everywhere. 3.Enhanced the thickness to avoid fragility - made by better material in case break up. 4.Withstand instantaneous temperature - Safe and reliable when boiling water pour. 5.Aesthetical style - Elegant,exquisite is fits to display on counter. 6.Detachable lid - Clean silicon ring in case remain fruit pulp. 7.Crystal clear - Glass Pitcher safe to drink. 8.Put it directly stove tops to boil water. 9.Wide mouth opening - Easy to clean,Fruit pulp nowhere to hide. 10.Taste the Difference - Our glass decanter lasts forever,Doesn't stain and won't absorb odor or color. Enjoy the tastiest and healthiest drinks with your whole family! Notice Tips for Glass Wares: All glass wares should be handled gently. Be careful with this pitcher when using or washing. Material:Borosilicate Glass /304 Stainless Steel Capacity:51 Ounces Dimensions:7 x 8 inches Lead-free:Yes Boiling Water:Yes Drinkware Type: Water/Iced Tea Pitcher Package:Pitcher,Silicone Ice Cube Tray,Cleaning Brush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r8GXJfUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOODESERVE","source_asin":"B07FPBFDCX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FPBFDCX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FPBFDCX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":349520,"name":"Maisha Hand Carved Fair Trade African Soapstone Hearts, Small Giraffe Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KXuxoCG4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Whether you're looking for a gift to give, for yourself, for the holidays, for special occasions or everyday use, this Maisha organic hand carved soapstone heart is Fair Trade, handmade in Africa with each piece being truly unique. Use this Maisha heart stone as a placemarker at the table of a special dinner such as weddings, banquets or Christmas; making every ocasion memorable. Give a heart and let your friends know special they are. When having a stressful moment hold onto the heart and focus on the good things or as a birthing stone. These hearts are smooth and feel good to hold in your hand. The color on the stones are made from local Kenyan plants. Laquers are not used to seal the color. Slight variations between each piece are signs that these pieces are individually handcarved; not mass produced. The tools used are basic, simple but authentic. Creating high quality home decorations is not Maisha's only concern. We care about the people who make these unique pieces. The Kenyan artists who make these pieces are paid Fair Trade prices for their crafts. Thank you for partnerring with us through your purchases to bring hope, healing, and prosperity to the poor in Africa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KXuxoCG4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maisha","source_asin":"B092PNWBH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092PNWBH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092PNWBH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
