window.products.push({"id":349672,"name":"Metal Pizza Peel 12\"x 14\" - 430 Stainless Steel Pizza Spatula with Foldable Long Handle, Convenient to Store, Pizza Paddle for Baking, Homemade Pizza ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616RWj16UbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heavy-duty, long-lasting 430 stainless steel pizza peel（12 inch ） Our metal pizza peel 12 inch can withstand even the heaviest deep dish pies.  The pizza paddle is a perfect match for any kitchen décor, gourmet pizza parlor and bakery. Sprinkle with flour, cornmeal or milled wheat bran, and then the pizza, bread and baked good slide easily onto the peel. Carefully place onto a pizza stone, baking sheet or tray with the peel. Once finished cooking, slide out the pizza, bread or baked goods from the oven using the peel. Materials: Metal Peel:Good grade 430 stainless steel Handle: Black rubber Measurement: Length in total: 24.5 inch Shovel Surface: 14*12 in Handle: 10.2 in Main Features: Long-Lasting 430 Stainless Steel With this pizza peel, cleanup is easy. Toss the peel into the dishwasher for a quick clean. High-quality stainless steel construction also makes it rust-free. Collapse & Store Easily Foldable design, simply fold the handle up and store to stave space, and with its convenient hang loop, you can hang up your pizza peel on a wall. Heat-Safe Rubber Handle The handle on your pizza paddle stays cool to protect your hands from burning. How to fold? 1. Unlock the folded handle 2. Unfold handle 3. Lock it in place","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616RWj16UbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handook","source_asin":"B07K2V9BFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K2V9BFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K2V9BFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
