window.products.push({"id":349689,"name":"HoneyHolly Stainless Steel Water Bottle - 12/17/22/25oz 650ml Vacuum Insulated Metal Reusable Flask Cola Bottle Shape, Keeps Hot & Cold, BPA Free Spor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PgeKBEywL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","description":"WITH NON SPILL LID CAP - The stainless steel water bottle with vacuum-seal cap provides a good seal and ensures no water leakage. Each drinking bottle is completely leak proof with an easy to open twist-on cap. No matter the temperature of the liquid in this bottle, it will never sweat or be hot to the touch.The narrow mouth and sealed sports bottle makes it easy to throw in your camping pack or back seat, no worrying about any spills. STAND OUT FROM THE CROWD - We all like to be unique and this beautifully colourful water bottle certainly makes a statement. With so many striking colours on offer, if being stylish and on-trend is high on your agenda look no further. P.S. You'll be helping the environment too, less plastic bottles is definitely a good thing for planet earth! THE PERFECT DRINK IN EVERY SCENARIO - This wildly popular bottle can be used at home, work, at the gym, for sports, in your car, at the beach, camping, hiking, travelling & just about any other activity you can dream up! What can be stored inside? Most drinks - including water, tea, coffee & wine. The Bottle will even fit in regular cup holders and its mouth is big enough for ice cubes to fit in. A PREMIUM ITEM, A LIFETIME INDEMITY- We know there are other bottles out there, but here at HoneyHolly we ensure the quality of our products with our lifetime indemnity , it's our promise that if you have a problem we'll fix it; simple as that. The bottle's stainless steel architecture means that it's robust, durable and can withstand some hit (unlike glass based vacuum flasks). The HoneyHolly Bottle is also 100% Leak Proof & BPA + Phthalate free, meaning it's safe for all the family! WHY BUY FROM HoneyHolly ? - Our Founder started HoneyHolly because he was completely fed up of below par customer service; as a result we treat our customers like family. Our products are backed by a full indemnity. If you are not completely satisfied with your bottle for any reason, contact us and we'll fully refund to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PgeKBEywL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HoneyHolly","source_asin":"B07HF3Z97G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HF3Z97G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HF3Z97G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
