window.products.push({"id":349710,"name":"SHAXIA Ultra Soft Duvet Cover Set, 3 Pieces Set (1 Comforter Cover and 2 Pillow Shams) with Zipper Closure, Printed Peach, Queen Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512eX0ROZUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Soft and Comfortable:：100% Polyester, soft and comfortable, designed to create a pleasant sleep. Size: Queen 1 x Duvet Cover 90’’x90’’(about 230cmx230cm) 2 x Pillowcases 20\"x30\" ( about 50cm x 75cm). (Tip: This is duvet cover set, without the comforter.) Zipper Closure : Invisible zipper design makes comforter easier to go in and out, convenient for disassembly and cleaning.Four corner ties ensure that your comforter remains immovable in the cover. Cute Pattern: Printed cartoon patterns, ideal gift for teens, boys, girls, men or women. WHAT YOU CAN GET: It does NOT include the comforter. This is duvet COVER, it's a cover for comforter or duvet. You need to put your own duvet inside just like you put a pillow inside the pillowcase. Easy Care: Machine wash in cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry at low heat, do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512eX0ROZUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHAXIA","source_asin":"B0924R2P52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0924R2P52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0924R2P52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
