window.products.push({"id":349802,"name":"LUXE Home Holiday Pine Cones Reed Diffuser Oil Set | A Winter Scent of Fresh Pine, Cinnamon Sticks, Clove, Cedarwood, Sandalwood & Vanilla | A or Stoc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xmCIvI6eL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"A Holiday Season blend of fresh Pine, Warm Cinnamon Sticks, Clove Buds and Texas Cedarwood with underlying fragrance notes of Sandalwood and Vanilla. Available exclusively on Amazon! Modern. Aromatic. Luxurious. LUXE HOME™ Fragrance Reed Diffusers are modern room fresheners made with an artisanal blend of unique botanicals and fine essential oils which will last up to 4 months. • Made in the USA• Filled with 5 oz of long-lasting fragrance oil• Beautifully presented in an opulent gift box.• Sleek, elegant glass bottles finished with a premium cork• Alcohol-Free. Paraben-Free. Phthalate-Free. 100% Vegan.• Designed to be used in any room of your home all-day, everyday.• Specially formulated to subtly scent your home with the fragrances you love. To use: Remove cork from bottle and immerse reeds into oil. Gently turn over and re-insert. Flip reeds as necessary for stronger scent. Our reeds are designed to gently release the fragrance slowly and evenly into the air for approximately 4 months. Tip #1: Place in the right spot.Air movement from outside or the motion of your household helps circulate the scent, creating the ideal “throw” of fragrance. Tip #2: Flip your reeds.Rattan reeds work to wick the scented oils from the container to the air, producing the fragrant impact you desire. By flipping them regularly, you’ll keep the scent at its freshest and most fragrant. Tip #3: Adjust scent to the desired intensity.To either heighten or lessen the fragrance level, simply increase or decrease the number of reeds placed in your vessel. Tip #4: Replace Reeds after 90 days.Once the reeds become saturated, their cells get clogged, reducing their ability to wick and throw fragrance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xmCIvI6eL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXEHOME","source_asin":"B07F388C9P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F388C9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F388C9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
