window.products.push({"id":349809,"name":"Boolegon Top Down Bottom Up Cellular Shades Blackout Cordless Honeycomb Blinds for Windows Cut to Size Custom Size Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ikQ2dJM5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Why Choosing \"Boolegon\" Branded Blinds & Shades】■With 22 years history,high quality cordless cellular shades, providing service guarantee■ Boolegon robust constant force spring-loaded mechanism has passed 10000 times usual lifting or top down bottom up tests.We provide free replacement service if the product has quality problems within 12 Months■■If you do not have the size you want in the options on the page, please contact us■ 【Energy saving】The blocking light cellular shades is made of non-woven fabric and polyester fiber fabric,shading,unique hexagonal honeycomb structure, built-in aluminum foil, can effectively heat insulation, heat preservation and reduce noise.In summer, it can effectively block outdoor heat,and in winter, it can effectively store indoor heating, thereby saving energy costs. 【Cordless system】Cellular blinds for windows,easy to install and hang. The cordless adjustable design is not only neat and beautiful, but also protects the safety of children and pets. The accordian curtains are easy to use. Gently push up or pull down, you can pull the curtain to any position you want.Three types of opening and closing are available to meet the needs for light, privacy, or both.The honeycomb shades is suitable for living room,study room,,bedroom and office. 【Measurement instructions】Inside Mount cell blinds custom for windows require a minimum 2\" window frame depth, sliding shades width need to be 1/4\" less than window width. Blinds for windows length need to same as window length. Outside mounting honeycomb shades, the cellular blinds need to be 4 inches wider and longer than window width and length for better coverage. 【Easy Installation & Fast Delivery】The order includes mounting brackets, screws, handles and instructions, and the product page also provides an easy-to-understand installation video. Can be installed quickly and easily, and removed quickly and easily.Our pleated window shades are made and shipped in short time. Your window shades should arrive between 5-12 Days from your order date depending on where you are located in the United States.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ikQ2dJM5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boolegon","source_asin":"B09H6N4FWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H6N4FWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H6N4FWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
