window.products.push({"id":349825,"name":"Electric Spin Scrubber, Electric Cleaning Brush with [3 Speed Modes and LED Display] and 5 Replaceable Brush Heads Power for Bathroom, Shower, Tile, T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KPGRfsphL._AC_.jpg","description":"Electric Spin Scrubber with LED Display: With LED display, you can easily check the information from this cordless spin scrubber, like the gear in use and the percentage of remaining power; it takes 6-8 seconds to switch. Electric Cleaning Brush with Long-lasting Runtime: With 4000mAh large-capacity rechargeable battery, this electric scrubber provides an outstanding cleaning performance for up to 30-90mins (Low Mode/ Standard Mode/Max Mode), which ensures thorough cleaning all around the house. The battery can be charged by a universal Type-c charger. Electric Scrubber Brush with Powerful Cleaning Power: With three-speed settings (350-400-450Rpm)， you can choose the most suitable spin speeds to clean the stubborn stains on your bathroom, shower, bathtub, stone tile, and stove. Press the switch button to switch gears, and long press the button to turn off the machine. Multi-Purpose and IPX-6 Water-resistant Automatic Spin Scrubber: Small flat brush for sink cleaning; large round brush for bathroom cleaning; tip brush for hard-to-reach corners cleaning; sponge brush for glass, stove, and other dirty surfaces; large flat brush for tiles and other large flat surfaces. Detachable Telescopic Rod and Flexible Bending Angles: Can be adjusted the length (14.1 inches to 54 inches) according to your height. No more bending and kneeling to clean, take care of your waist and joints, ideal for the elderly, pregnant women, and people with waist problems. Moreover, the angle of the brush head can be flexibly adjusted (90°-120°-150°-180°), according to the needs of cleaning different cleaning positions. 2-Year Protection Plan: If you have any other questions about this product, please feel free to let us know and we will try our best to solve your issue as soon as possible. Notes: Forbid to sink the entire machine head in water, and the water level cannot exceed the lowest line of the LED screen. And Excessive force during use will cause the machine to trigger the power-off protection setting and stop working.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KPGRfsphL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"laapee","source_asin":"B0BVQ7SHGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVQ7SHGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVQ7SHGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
