window.products.push({"id":349896,"name":"Hanging Baskets For Organizing – Hanging Wire Basket, Over The Cabinet Door Organizer, Wall Hanging Baskets, Hanging Fruit Basket, Pantry Door Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fUpmnkJJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want to declutter and organize your things to have a neater place Jërellis wall baskets are made of strong iron material coated with corrosion-resistant powder which makes the baskets very durable and sturdy. Its simple yet practical design makes the wire baskets blend into any rooms. You can use them as wall storage in your kitchen, pantry, bedrooms, storerooms, study rooms, garage etc. Tired of messy rooms and the need to rummage through boxes or cupboards You can take this opportunity to declutter and organize your things into our wire baskets. Its open grid design lets you see what are inside the baskets at one glance. The wall baskets do not need drilling. It is easy to install with the adhesive plastic hooks included. Extra plastic hooks are given for greater flexibility in case you decide to change the location of the wall basket. Save up space and organize your home with our great value wall baskets Another benefit of getting these baskets is its versatility. You can hang them on walls, on cabinet doors or put the baskets on tabletops or shelves. The baskets are perfectly sized to fit in cabinets and drawers. Organize your pantry with snacks stored neatly in our baskets. Each set also comes with 4 S hooks for you to hang light items. If you are using the wall baskets in bathroom for shampoos and shower gels, you can hang your bath sponge, face towel or shower hats on the S hooks In the kitchen, you can use the S hooks to hang your turner or ladle while the baskets hold the condiments. There is no limit in how you want to use them. You will be having a clean and organized home in no time Learn more about our wall baskets: -Items included: 2 wall baskets, 6 adhesive plastic hooks, 4 S hooks -Size: 11.02 inch (L) x 4.92 inch (W) x 4.72 inch (H) (per basket) -Color: Black -Made of Iron coated with corrosion-resistant powder Clear up the mess with our wall baskets Add to cart today","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fUpmnkJJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jërellis","source_asin":"B092CJ9QPP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092CJ9QPP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092CJ9QPP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
