window.products.push({"id":349962,"name":"Apple Slicer and Corer 【UPGRADED】Apple Cutter Stainless Steel Heavy Duty【4-in-1】 Kitchen Gadgets- Extra Large Decorer Tools - 12 Slices Wedger Ultra S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cHn72lNML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"<p><b>[ULTRA SHARP& HEAVY DUTY& EXTREMELY DURABLE]</b>Our apple slicer is compeletely constructed with 100% stainless steel.Super-quality 304 food-grade stainless steel blades assure you an ultra sharp & Non-rusting Apple Slicer and Corer.It's totally different  from any other decorer tools with plastic material that easy to break. You'll never regret to have Such strong & durable apple slicer as a kitchen gadget to bring you an easy and comfortable life.</p> <p><b>[Super Large Size& More small slices] </b>Slicing Area with Diameter up to 4.1 inches (10.5 cm), suitable for various apples, pears, Dragon fruits --Pitaya,Pomegranate,Cantaloupe,Guavaetc. Even big ones. 12  blades promise with more small-bite sliced fruit.An helpful kitchen utensils& gadgets for cooking and baking. Efficent to assist to prepare apple pies,Salads  fruit desserts etc..</p> <p><b>[EASY TO USE& EASY TO CLEAN.]</b>Simply slice and core the apples /pears/onion etc just by down-toward pushing the apple slicer and corer,the apples will be immediately divided into 12 small pieces with core out.Then just rinse the apple slicer under the running water or wash it in the dishwasher.</p> <p>EFFICIENT & ENJOY SHARING.No need to use knife to cut apple one piece by another piece any more.This apple slicer and corer will save your time to decorer the apple core immediately & meanwhile divide it into 12 small pieces.With such helpful kitchen gadgets,we can enjoy various fruits with friends and family.Keeping an healthy life by absorbing more vatamin from kinds of fruit.</p> 【What You'll Get& Buy With Confidence】. 4-in-1 packed in Gift Box.Including 1 x Apple Slicer Corer+ 1 x Cleaning Brush+ 1 x Orange Peeler+ 1 x Multifunction two-blade peeler.If you're unsatisfied with the core removal tool,Please directly request a Full Refund or Replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cHn72lNML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yhtawoo","source_asin":"B0BPYZMBBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPYZMBBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPYZMBBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
