window.products.push({"id":349982,"name":"Orient Sense Gold and Black Queen 3 Piece Full Zen Garden Embroidered Oriental Bamboo Style Design 100% Cotton Sateen Duvet Cover Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71He6lmo1mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design inspired by the Zen Garden Bamboo is used in the Zen Garden. The bamboo is a symbol of longevity, it is always green, as well as of graceful strength, it bends readily but snaps rarely. In eastern philosophy, a stem of bamboo unveils the way towards enlightenment, with the segments being the eightfold path. Orient Sense Orient Sense’s mission is to bring culturally rich and timeless oriental ideas into your every day living. Our collections embody the Eastern aesthetic of elegance in a unique style. Each of our designs begins with a story. That story provides the essence, feeling and soul of the design.  Our dedicated creative team work to translate the story to living fashion and deliver traditional elements in a magical balance.  Orient Sense is an innovative fashion bed linen company, founded in Sydney, Australia in 2002. We are proudly a boutique fashion brand where quality of design, fabric and manufacture are essential. This dedication has seen our collections stocked in many retail stores across Australia, New Zealand and the US. Now our exclusive “online collection” is available to you through Amazon. We hope you find something that will inspire and enrich your living. Measurements Full Queen size set includes one duvet cover and two standard shams. Full Queen Size Duvet Cover:: 88\"(width) x 92\"(length) Standard Sham: 20\" x 26\" King size set includes one duvet covers and two king shams. King Size Duvet Cover: 106\"(width) x 92\"(length) King Sham: 20\" x 36\" Standard sham pack includes two standard pillow shams. Standard Sham: 20\" x 26\" Euro Sham: 26\" x 26\", Decorative Pillow: 16\" x 16\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71He6lmo1mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orient Sense","source_asin":"B01ETGMHJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-349982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ETGMHJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ETGMHJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
